sequenceDiagram
    participant You
    participant CLI as AWS CLI (profile flowguard-sso)
    participant IdC as IAM Identity Center
    participant AWS as AWS APIs
    You->>CLI: aws sso login --profile flowguard-sso
    CLI->>IdC: device authorisation (browser sign-in, MFA)
    IdC-->>CLI: temporary role credentials (expire on their own)
    You->>CLI: python deploy/aws_deploy.py plan ... --live
    CLI->>AWS: signed requests with the temporary credentials
    Note over You,AWS: No key in the repository, in deploy/config.toml, in the image, or in the task definition
